<h1 class=3D"content-item__title">Student Diversity at More Than 4,600 Inst=
itutions</h1>
<div class=3D"content-item__spacer">
    <span class=3D"content-item__byline">
</span><span id=3D"di_pubdate" class=3D"content-item__date">
September 18, 2016</span>
</div>

<p>The table that follows shows the race, ethnicity, and gender of students=
 at 4,605 colleges and universities in the fall of 2014, the latest year fo=
r which statistics are available from the U.S. Department of Education.</p>

<p>The figures are from the Education Department=E2=80=99s Integrated Posts=
econdary Education Data System. They include undergraduate, graduate, and p=
rofessional-school students attending full time and part time in the 50 sta=
tes and Washington, D.C.</p>

